# Build artifacts
BuiltPlugin/Binaries/Win64/*.pdb
BuiltPlugin/Intermediate/
# Covers _build_output/ (default RunUAT target) and the suffixed variants
# _build_output_5_7/ (stock UE 5.7), _build_output_dow/ (custom UE_DOW),
# _build_output_bphtests/ (BugHunt tests). Some of these are live junction
# targets for external installs (e.g. UE_DOW_Legacy/Plugins/BlueprintExporter
# → _build_output_5_7), so do NOT delete them; just don't stage them either.
_build_output*/
_compile_check/

# Inventory subsystem ephemerals. ProjectInventory/ (BugHunt smoke output)
# is fully ephemeral. ProjectInventory_DOW/ is the canonical committed
# deliverable EXCEPT for its Deep/ subdir which is on-demand DeepDump output
# that should be regenerated, not committed.
ProjectInventory/
ProjectInventory_DOW/Deep/

# Verification twin-run outputs (always ephemeral; verify_determinism.ps1
# cleans these on success but leaves them on failure for inspection).
_determinism_A/
_determinism_A_logs/
_determinism_B/
_determinism_B_logs/
_deep_st_A/
_deep_st_B/

# Commandlet / build log captures from manual verification runs.
_*.log

# BugHunt/ — dev-only workstream. Build outputs and local plugin-discovery
# junctions live here and must never be committed.
BugHunt/TestProject/Binaries/
BugHunt/TestProject/Build/
BugHunt/TestProject/DerivedDataCache/
BugHunt/TestProject/Intermediate/
BugHunt/TestProject/Saved/
BugHunt/TestProject/*.sln
BugHunt/TestProject/.vs/
BugHunt/TestProject/Plugins/BlueprintExporter/
BugHunt/TestProject/Plugins/BlueprintExporterTests
BugHunt/BlueprintExporterTests/Binaries/
BugHunt/BlueprintExporterTests/Intermediate/

# UE auto-generated on first editor run — never milestone content.
# DefaultEngine.ini / DefaultGame.ini ARE tracked (authored configuration);
# DefaultInput.ini is generated from engine defaults the first time the
# project loads, so it varies per machine and must stay out.
BugHunt/TestProject/Config/DefaultInput.ini
# Plugin Config dir auto-created on first package load. Contents are
# boilerplate FilterPlugin.ini etc. — never committed.
BugHunt/BlueprintExporterTests/Config/

# Inspect-harness scratch assets. The M28.pre.2 verify_post_apply_inspect
# harness duplicates fixtures into scratch paths like
# BP_BpxTest_<Something>Scratch_<Op>.uasset to exercise ops without
# touching source fixtures. Normal runs clean up; -KeepScratch or a
# failed cleanup leaves residue which must not be staged.
BugHunt/TestProject/Content/TestBlueprints/*Scratch*.uasset

# IDE
.vs/
*.sln
*.vcxproj*

# Python artefacts (scripts/python_ops/ + scripts/blueprint-exporter-mcp/)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
scripts/blueprint-exporter-mcp/build/
scripts/blueprint-exporter-mcp/dist/
